msgstr "It's turned off and a backup is saved first. You can go back with Restore. Some changes need lumen to run as administrator."

msgid "Se vuelve a dejar como estaba antes de que lumen lo deshabilitara."
msgstr "It goes back to how it was before lumen disabled it."

msgid "¿Aplicar las mejoras recomendadas?"
